        "worship",
        "cult"
      ],
      "context_support_ratio": 1.0,
      "failure_surface": "pass",
      "stage_loss_tokens": {
        "shepherds": "hit",
        "maelthor": "hit",
        "worship": "retriever_gap",
        "cult": "hit"
      },
      "stale_hits": [],
      "global_stale_hits": [],
      "answer": "TL;DR: The Shepherds (the Shepherd\u2019s Flock) are a cult-like group actively recruiting and agitating in the city, and they answer to the power/entity known as Maelthor.\n\nThe **Shepherds**, formally called the **Shepherd\u2019s Flock**, are a cult organization operating within the city. They are currently **staging protests at the gates** and **actively recruiting transformed individuals** into their ranks. Their ideology frames their actions\u2014potentially violent or corruptive\u2014as **\u201cnecessary sacrifices\u201d to cleanse the world of impurities** and promote **human supremacy**. They also conceal darker activities (e.g., **hiding corrupted meat**) and mark their presence with identifiable symbols.\n\nIn terms of allegiance, the projection is clear:  \n- **OBSERVED:** They are **followers of Maelthor** and are aligned with **Maelthor\u2019s influence and emergence**.  \n- Their beliefs and actions are explicitly justified as serving this power.\n\nBerin and others only know fragments, reinforcing that much of the group\u2019s structure and full intent remains obscured in play.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Role: Cultists staging protests and recruiting\n- Allegiance: Maelthor (primary power they serve)\n- Activities: Recruitment, propaganda, concealment (e.g., corrupted meat)\n- Ideology: \u201cCleansing\u201d the world, human supremacy\n- Presence: Visible agitation at city gates, symbolic markings on bodies",
      "embedding_similarity": null
    },
    {
      "id": "q_the_city_council_2",
      "question": "Who speaks for the wizards on the council, and what's his angle on the cult?",
      "strict_verdict": "pass_updated",
      "semantic_verdict": "pass_updated",
      "must_hits": [
        "headmaster tinkerbright",
        "wizard's college",
