      "answer": "TL;DR: Torrin is the Guilds\u2019 representative (Master Smith). The projection does not contain enough information to determine Merril or Rurik\u2019s council roles.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Torrin Flamescale (CANON + OBSERVED)\n  - Role: Master Smith; Representative of the Craft Guilds / Guilds\n  - Faction: the Guilds\n  - Function on council: Speaks for craftsmen and guild interests; known to speak bluntly on city issues\n\n- Merril\n  - No role or council position is stated in the provided projection.\n\n- Rurik Stonehammer\n  - Only referenced indirectly via \u201chis city (Rurik Stonehammer's city)\u201d (OBSERVED relationship tag)\n  - No explicit council job or title is provided in the projection\n\nIf you need exact council duties for Merril or Rurik, that information isn\u2019t present in this context.",
      "embedding_similarity": null
