      "stale_hits": [],
      "global_stale_hits": [],
      "answer": "TL;DR: The Wolf ends the council-chamber fight dead\u2014**\u201cDecapitated; head removed from body\u201d**\u2014with Bonogo having **\u201cRemoved the Wolf\u2019s head to transport it.\u201d**\n\nThere are conflicting OBSERVED states showing The Wolf attempting escape (invisibility, fleeing via the secret tunnel), but the later, decisive outcome is his death. The presence of **\u201cDecapitated; head removed from body\u201d** and Bonogo\u2019s follow-up action **\u201cRemoved the Wolf\u2019s head to transport it\u201d** indicate this is the final, current state, overriding earlier escape attempts.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Status: Dead (decapitated)\n- Body: Separated; head taken by Bonogo\n- Prior state (overridden): Invisible and attempting escape via secret passage\n- Role in scene: Central adversary in the council chamber battle, now neutralized\n\nSo when the fight resolves, The Wolf is not at large\u2014he\u2019s been killed and physically removed in part from the scene.",
      "embedding_similarity": null
    },
